摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Agent skills for building and testing DeepSeek Harness plugins — from scaffolding a new plugin package to choosing the right test tiers, entirely inside an agent session.","id":"gh:1330573139","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"dsh-plugin-skills","slug":"omdsh-dev/dsh-plugin-skills","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Agent skills for building and testing DeepSeek Harness plugins — from scaffolding a new plugin packa"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ge to choosing the right test tiers, entirely inside an agent session."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Agent skills for building and testing **DeepSeek Harness** plugins — from scaffolding a new plugin p"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ackage to choosing the right test tiers, entirely inside an agent session."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What's inside"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Skill              | What it does                                                                 "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"                                                                                                    "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"                                                                                         |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `dsh-write-plugin` | Scaffolds a plugin end to end: pick the right shape (tool / LLM adapter / hoo"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"k / service / config), walk the package checklist (package.json invariants, tsconfig registration, R"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"EADME + Model Experience, verify gates), with a self-contained reference file per shape. |\n| `dsh-te"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"st-plugin`  | Picks the right test tiers for a plugin change: unit, per-file coverage gate, real-API"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" e2e, keyless snapshots, web browser snapshots — and when each is *required*, including real-entry-p"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ath and built-bin smoke coverage.                                               |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Both skills are **fully self-contained**: no external docs or other skills needed at runtime — every"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"thing required is written inside the skill."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Copy the skill folders into your project's agent skills directory:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Claude Code projects usually symlink `.claude/skills` to `.agents/skills`; if yours does not:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"That's it. The agent picks the skills up automatically (the skill catalog hot-refreshes on disk chan"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ges) — just ask it to *write a plugin* or *test this plugin change*, or invoke a skill by name."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Runs in any mainstream agent product** — the skills are plain `SKILL.md` Markdown directories with"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" no product-specific glue, so they work wherever an agent can read skill instructions: Codex, Claude"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" Code, DeepSeek Harness, Cursor, Windsurf, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot, Cline, Roo Code, OpenHands, A"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ider, Devin, and more."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
